    duplicate liquid mode row, five surface-lighting combinations, four atmosphere cases, three
    ordinary water rows, two overlay rows and one standalone CPU publication fact. The baseline
    has 150 cases across 13 affected classes; the candidate has 130. Exact runtime-name reconciliation
    removes 21 names and adds the merged blue-noise name; all 129 unchanged focused names retain
    their test IDs. The added assertion-bearing witnesses run in the surviving cases, including
    the 17×9 atmosphere tail, both quality endpoints, each AO mode and initial CPU publication.
    Cold-load, lifecycle, stress, diagnostic-only water and other nominated controls remain.
    Source-derived avoided work is one blue-noise generator call (four -> three), three AO
    executable creations (six -> three while all 96 composition invocations remain), one
    installed-liquid native compile/link row and two endpoint atmosphere table builds. These
    operation counts do not measure driver time or guarantee wall-clock savings.
    Clean-tree matched retained-cache Release focused runs take 80.217s before / 55.600s after,
    each passing its 150 / 130 cases. The candidate's expanded focused selection passes 135/135
    in both Debug and Release, including both-gather numerical and atmosphere day/night witnesses.
    Both corrected configuration builds pass; an initial wrong offline NuGet package path and an
